OL,3,GNEWSAMercury Prize to be announced with
OL,4,AOlivia Dean, Raye and Dave among those
OL,5,Ashortlisted
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Mercury Prize returns to Newcastle
OL,8,Fas 12 artists wait to see if they have
OL,9,Fwon the prestigious award
OL,11,FThe prize honours the best overall
OL,12,Falbum from the UK or Ireland, with the
OL,13,Fwinner being chosen by a panel of music
OL,14,Fexperts
OL,16,FOlivia Dean, Florence + the Machine,
OL,17,FRaye, and Dave are among the favourites
OL,18,Fon tonight's shortlist
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
