OL,3,GNEWSAMercury Prize to be announced with
OL,4,AOlivia Dean, Raye and Dave among those
OL,5,Ashortlisted
OL,6,
OL,7,FWe've already seen the stars out on the
OL,8,Fred carpet tonight - "I feel like I'm
OL,9,Fstill in this crazy whirlwind of it
OL,10,Fall," Olivia Dean tells the BBC about
OL,11,Fher recent success
OL,13,FThe ceremony is being hosted in
OL,14,FNewcastle for the second time - it was
OL,15,Ffirst held in the city last year, when
OL,16,Fthe #25,000 prize was won by local
OL,17,Fresident Sam Fender
OL,19,FYou can listen to the ceremony live on
OL,20,FRadio 6 Music at the top of this page
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
